OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fcontinuing in the northwest this
OL,7,Fevening, spreading further inland
OL,8,Fovernight and turning cloudier by
OL,9,Fdawn. Feeling cooler and less humid
OL,10,Fcompared to previous nights with a
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly beeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA mixture of sunshine and
OL,14,Fshowers on Wednesday, these most
OL,15,Ffrequent in the morning before easing
OL,16,Ffrom the west. Rain then arriving
OL,17,Fovernight. Temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
